    <summary>Open-source video pipeline (clipper, AI video and more) for content creators.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[ViralMint is an open-source desktop video pipeline. It runs a local server with its interface in your browser and covers the path from idea to finished video:

* trend scouting on YouTube, TikTok and Douyin with outlier scores
* video downloads and local Whisper transcription
* AI clip extraction from long videos
* script-to-video with stock footage, voiceover and word-by-word captions
* AI video and image generation, motion graphics
* single-purpose editing tools that mostly run locally on FFmpeg

Bring your own AI key (Anthropic, OpenAI, OpenRouter) or point it at any OpenAI-compatible server such as Ollama or LM Studio. Finished videos are saved locally; nothing is uploaded automatically.

ViralMint starts as a tray icon and opens its interface in your default browser.

## Package notes

* Installs the portable build into the package folder and adds a Start Menu shortcut plus a `viralmint` command.
* User data is stored in `%USERPROFILE%\ViralMint` and is kept on uninstall.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/openclaw-easy/ViralMint/releases/tag/v1.3.1</releaseNotes>
